GODMODE 0.15.1

  GODMODE gives your agents the goddamn keys.

  Your profile and keys are stored in local files. Agents use these
  keys as you. They can spend money, change live systems and delete data.

Install

  gh api -H 'Accept: application/vnd.github.raw+json' \
    repos/lofimichael/godmode-cli/contents/install.sh | sh -s -- --path

Commands

  godmode               profile, providers and agents
  godmode faq           keys, files and source
  godmode music         local synth and audio visualizer
  godmode music clear   clear synthesized music

Source

  https://github.com/lofimichael/godmode-cli

  Bubble Tea and Lip Gloss drive the Go interface. The Python file engine
  is embedded in it. The separate source archive includes Go, Python
  and pinned vendored dependencies.
  godmode source prints the engine. godmode build-info lists dependencies.

Music

  Darunia's CLI: https://github.com/lofimichael/darunias-cli
  Local tools and songs stay outside this archive.

  godmode picard link   the original YTMND URL
  godmode picard play   loop its audio
  godmode picard stop   stop the player

  Picard downloads media from https://picard.ytmnd.com/ on request.
  Music by DarkMateria. The MIT license covers Godmode's code, not that
  image or recording, Darunia's code, soundfonts or songs.

